    "note": "INEC's registered and collected state rows sum to the published national totals. The published uncollected counts do not reconcile: state-row sum, printed national total, and registered-minus-collected arithmetic differ. Preserve the source values and publish this discrepancy; do not substitute the calculated value for INEC's reported value. The same INEC 2023 General Election Report narrative in Section 8.4 states that 87,394,106 PVCs were collected, while its Table 8.13 and the 5 February 2023 summary report 87,209,007. This is a 185,099 difference within the same official report. Preserve both statements; neither is silently substituted for the other.",
